warning: redundant `= nil` initializer, because uninitialized locals are `nil`
 --> Standalone:1:1
1 | local x = nil
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: drop the `= nil` to rely on the default value
fix: drop redundant `= nil` initializer
  | local x

